  "label": "Stereotype: Black Man as Fool",
  "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that Black men are 'fools' or 'simpletons' who are easily led astray by women, particularly in financial matters. This stereotype is used to justify the moralistic warning and to position the Black man as the 'victim' of his own choices, which is a form of racialized victim-blaming.",
